---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, "/");

const principles = [
  {
    letter: "S",
    title: "Single Responsibility",
    subtitle: "Una clase, una razón para cambiar",
    labelLines: ["Single", "Responsibility"],
    tone: "green",
    modalBg: "#1f5a49",
    definition:
      "Cada clase debe tener una única responsabilidad. Cuando mezclás persistencia, reglas, notificaciones y orquestación en un mismo punto, cualquier cambio termina rompiendo más de lo que debería.",
    badLabel: "❌ Todo mezclado",
    badCode:
      '<span class="kw">public class</span> <span class="cls">UserService</span> {\n  <span class="kw">public</span> User getUser(<span class="kw">long</span> id){...}\n  <span class="kw">public void</span> <span class="fn">sendEmail</span>(User u){\n    <span class="cmt">// lógica de email aquí ❌</span>\n  }\n  <span class="kw">public void</span> <span class="fn">saveToDB</span>(User u){\n    <span class="cmt">// lógica de BD aquí ❌</span>\n  }\n}',
    goodLabel: "✅ Responsabilidades separadas",
    goodCode:
      '<span class="kw">public class</span> <span class="cls">UserService</span> {\n  <span class="kw">private final</span> UserRepository repo;\n  <span class="kw">private final</span> EmailService mail;\n\n  <span class="kw">public</span> User getUser(<span class="kw">long</span> id){\n    <span class="kw">return</span> repo.findById(id);\n  }\n}\n\n<span class="kw">public class</span> <span class="cls">EmailService</span> {\n  <span class="kw">public void</span> <span class="fn">sendWelcome</span>(User user){...}\n}',
    tip: "<b>Spring Boot:</b> separá <code>@Controller</code>, <code>@Service</code> y <code>@Repository</code>. Cada capa debería tener una única razón de cambio.",
  },
  {
    letter: "O",
    title: "Open / Closed",
    subtitle: "Abierto a extensión, cerrado a modificación",
    labelLines: ["Open", "Closed"],
    tone: "moss",
    modalBg: "#365f3f",
    definition:
      "El diseño tiene que aceptar nuevas variantes sin reescribir el corazón del caso de uso. Si cada nuevo requisito obliga a tocar la misma clase, la arquitectura ya te está gritando que falta una abstracción.",
    badLabel: "❌ if/else por cada caso",
    badCode:
      '<span class="kw">public class</span> <span class="cls">DiscountService</span> {\n  <span class="kw">public double</span> <span class="fn">calculate</span>(String type, <span class="kw">double</span> price){\n    <span class="kw">if</span>(type.equals(<span class="cls">"VIP"</span>)) <span class="kw">return</span> price * 0.8;\n    <span class="kw">if</span>(type.equals(<span class="cls">"STUDENT"</span>)) <span class="kw">return</span> price * 0.9;\n    <span class="cmt">// nuevo tipo = tocar esta clase ❌</span>\n    <span class="kw">return</span> price;\n  }\n}',
    goodLabel: "✅ Strategy extensible",
    goodCode:
      '<span class="kw">public interface</span> <span class="cls">DiscountStrategy</span> {\n  <span class="kw">double</span> apply(<span class="kw">double</span> price);\n}\n\n<span class="kw">public class</span> <span class="cls">VipDiscount</span> <span class="kw">implements</span> <span class="cls">DiscountStrategy</span> {\n  <span class="kw">public double</span> <span class="fn">apply</span>(<span class="kw">double</span> price){\n    <span class="kw">return</span> price * 0.8;\n  }\n}\n\n<span class="cmt">// nuevo tipo = nueva clase ✅</span>',
    tip: "<b>Spring Boot:</b> podés inyectar una <code>List&lt;DiscountStrategy&gt;</code> y dejar que el framework descubra todas las implementaciones.",
  },
  {
    letter: "L",
    title: "Liskov Substitution",
    subtitle: "Los subtipos deben ser sustituibles",
    labelLines: ["Liskov", "Substitution"],
    tone: "plum",
    modalBg: "#6d2d54",
    definition:
      "Si un subtipo rompe el contrato esperado por el tipo padre, la herencia deja de ser reutilización y pasa a ser una fuente elegante de bugs. Acá importa el comportamiento, no el árbol de clases.",
    badLabel: "❌ Herencia que rompe el contrato",
    badCode:
      '<span class="kw">public class</span> <span class="cls">Rectangle</span> {\n  <span class="kw">void</span> setWidth(<span class="kw">int</span> width){...}\n  <span class="kw">void</span> setHeight(<span class="kw">int</span> height){...}\n}\n\n<span class="kw">public class</span> <span class="cls">Square</span> <span class="kw">extends</span> <span class="cls">Rectangle</span> {\n  <span class="kw">void</span> setWidth(<span class="kw">int</span> width){\n    <span class="kw">super</span>.setWidth(width);\n    <span class="kw">super</span>.setHeight(width); <span class="cmt">// ❌</span>\n  }\n}',
    goodLabel: "✅ Contrato explícito",
    goodCode:
      '<span class="kw">public interface</span> <span class="cls">Shape</span> { <span class="kw">int</span> area(); }\n\n<span class="kw">public class</span> <span class="cls">Rectangle</span> <span class="kw">implements</span> <span class="cls">Shape</span> {\n  <span class="kw">private int</span> width, height;\n  <span class="kw">public int</span> area(){ <span class="kw">return</span> width * height; }\n}\n\n<span class="kw">public class</span> <span class="cls">Square</span> <span class="kw">implements</span> <span class="cls">Shape</span> {\n  <span class="kw">private int</span> side;\n  <span class="kw">public int</span> area(){ <span class="kw">return</span> side * side; }\n}',
    tip: "<b>Regla práctica:</b> si al sobreescribir un método cambiás el comportamiento esperado, probablemente necesitás composición o una interfaz más honesta.",
  },
  {
    letter: "I",
    title: "Interface Segregation",
    subtitle: "Interfaces específicas, no generales",
    labelLines: ["Interface", "Segregation"],
    tone: "amber",
    modalBg: "#8b603b",
    definition:
      "No obligues a una implementación a cargar métodos que no necesita. Las interfaces enormes generan acoplamiento innecesario y clases llenas de excepciones o métodos vacíos.",
    badLabel: "❌ Interfaz dios",
    badCode:
      '<span class="kw">public interface</span> <span class="cls">Worker</span> {\n  <span class="kw">void</span> work();\n  <span class="kw">void</span> eat();\n  <span class="kw">void</span> sleep();\n}\n\n<span class="kw">public class</span> <span class="cls">RobotWorker</span> <span class="kw">implements</span> <span class="cls">Worker</span> {\n  <span class="kw">public void</span> eat(){ <span class="kw">throw new</span> UnsupportedOperationException(); }\n  <span class="kw">public void</span> sleep(){ <span class="kw">throw new</span> UnsupportedOperationException(); }\n}',
    goodLabel: "✅ Interfaces finas",
    goodCode:
      '<span class="kw">public interface</span> <span class="cls">Workable</span> { <span class="kw">void</span> work(); }\n<span class="kw">public interface</span> <span class="cls">Eatable</span> { <span class="kw">void</span> eat(); }\n<span class="kw">public interface</span> <span class="cls">Sleepable</span> { <span class="kw">void</span> sleep(); }\n\n<span class="kw">public class</span> <span class="cls">HumanWorker</span> <span class="kw">implements</span> <span class="cls">Workable</span>, <span class="cls">Eatable</span>, <span class="cls">Sleepable</span> { ... }\n<span class="kw">public class</span> <span class="cls">RobotWorker</span> <span class="kw">implements</span> <span class="cls">Workable</span> { ... }',
    tip: "<b>Spring Data:</b> la familia <code>CrudRepository</code>, <code>PagingAndSortingRepository</code> y <code>JpaRepository</code> es un buen ejemplo de segregación por necesidad real.",
  },
  {
    letter: "D",
    title: "Dependency Inversion",
    subtitle: "Dependé de abstracciones, no de concretos",
    labelLines: ["Dependency", "Inversion"],
    tone: "umber",
    modalBg: "#4c3a2d",
    definition:
      "Los casos de uso de alto nivel no deberían conocer detalles de infraestructura. Cuando dependés de interfaces, el cambio de implementación deja de contaminar tu lógica de negocio.",
    badLabel: "❌ Acoplado a implementación",
    badCode:
      '<span class="kw">public class</span> <span class="cls">OrderService</span> {\n  <span class="cmt">// Acoplado a MySQL ❌</span>\n  <span class="kw">private</span> MySQLRepo repo = <span class="kw">new</span> <span class="cls">MySQLRepo</span>();\n\n  <span class="kw">public void</span> save(Order order){\n    repo.save(order);\n  }\n}',
    goodLabel: "✅ Inyección por constructor",
    goodCode:
      '<span class="ann">@Service</span>\n<span class="kw">public class</span> <span class="cls">OrderService</span> {\n  <span class="kw">private final</span> OrderRepository repo;\n\n  <span class="kw">public</span> <span class="fn">OrderService</span>(OrderRepository repo){\n    <span class="kw">this</span>.repo = repo;\n  }\n\n  <span class="kw">public void</span> save(Order order){\n    repo.save(order);\n  }\n}',
    tip: "<b>Spring Boot:</b> con un único constructor la inyección ya es implícita. Queda más claro, más testeable y menos acoplado a infraestructura concreta.",
  },
];

const graphNodes = [
  { index: 0, top: "8%", left: "50%" },
  { index: 1, top: "27%", left: "82%" },
  { index: 2, top: "69%", left: "72%" },
  { index: 3, top: "69%", left: "28%" },
  { index: 4, top: "27%", left: "18%" },
].map((node) => ({ ...node, ...principles[node.index] }));

---

<Layout
  title="Clean Code"
  description="Mapa interactivo de principios SOLID con ejemplos reales de Java y Spring Boot dentro del portfolio de Garal."
>
  <div class="solid-page">
    <div class="solid-shell">
      <a class="solid-back" href={baseUrl}>← Volver al portfolio</a>

      <header class="solid-banner" data-animate>
        <div class="tag">Garal · Clean Code</div>
        <h1>Principios <em>SOLID</em></h1>
        <p>
          Un mapa visual para explicar decisiones de diseño que hacen el código más estable,
          más mantenible y mucho menos frágil cuando el producto cambia.
        </p>
      </header>

        <div class="solid-graph" aria-label="Mapa interactivo de principios SOLID">
          <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div>
          <div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>

          <span class="solid-edge edge-top" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="solid-edge edge-right" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="solid-edge edge-bottom-right" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="solid-edge edge-bottom-left" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <span class="solid-edge edge-left" aria-hidden="true"></span>

          <div class="solid-center" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="solid-center-title">SOLID</span>
            <span class="solid-center-subtitle">PRINCIPIOS</span>
          </div>

          {graphNodes.map((node) => (
            <button
              type="button"
              class={`solid-node tone-${node.tone}`}
              style={`top:${node.top};left:${node.left};`}
              data-solid-open={node.index}
              aria-label={`Abrir detalle de ${node.title}`}
            >
              <span class="node-letter">{node.letter}</span>
              <span class="node-copy">
                {node.labelLines.map((line) => (
                  <span>{line}</span>
                ))}
              </span>
            </button>
          ))}
        </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ov" id="ov" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="mt1">
      <div class="mh">
        <div class="ml" id="ml"></div>
        <div class="mt">
          <h2 id="mt1"></h2>
          <p id="mt2"></p>
        </div>
        <button class="mx" id="mx" type="button" aria-label="Cerrar modal">✕</button>
      </div>
      <div class="mb">
        <p class="def" id="mdef"></p>
        <div class="cmp">
          <div class="cb bad">
            <div class="ch"><span class="cd"></span><span id="mbl"></span></div>
            <pre id="mbc"></pre>
          </div>
          <div class="cb good">
            <div class="ch"><span class="cd"></span><span id="mgl"></span></div>
            <pre id="mgc"></pre>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tip">💡 <span id="mtip"></span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script type="application/json" id="solid-principles" set:html={JSON.stringify(principles)}></script>

  <script>
    const rawData = document.getElementById("solid-principles");
    const DATA = rawData ? JSON.parse(rawData.textContent ?? "[]") : [];

    const overlay = document.getElementById("ov");
    const closeButton = document.getElementById("mx");
    const letterEl = document.getElementById("ml");
    const titleEl = document.getElementById("mt1");
    const subtitleEl = document.getElementById("mt2");
    const definitionEl = document.getElementById("mdef");
    const badLabelEl = document.getElementById("mbl");
    const badCodeEl = document.getElementById("mbc");
    const goodLabelEl = document.getElementById("mgl");
    const goodCodeEl = document.getElementById("mgc");
    const tipEl = document.getElementById("mtip");

    const closeModal = () => {
      overlay?.classList.remove("on");
      overlay?.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "true");
      document.body.style.overflow = "";
    };

    const openModal = (index) => {
      const item = DATA[index];
      if (!item || !overlay || !letterEl || !titleEl || !subtitleEl || !definitionEl || !badLabelEl || !badCodeEl || !goodLabelEl || !goodCodeEl || !tipEl) {
        return;
      }

      letterEl.textContent = item.letter;
      letterEl.style.background = item.modalBg;
      titleEl.textContent = item.title;
      subtitleEl.textContent = item.subtitle;
      definitionEl.textContent = item.definition;
      badLabelEl.textContent = item.badLabel;
      badCodeEl.innerHTML = item.badCode;
      goodLabelEl.textContent = item.goodLabel;
      goodCodeEl.innerHTML = item.goodCode;
      tipEl.innerHTML = item.tip;
      overlay.classList.add("on");
      overlay.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "false");
      document.body.style.overflow = "hidden";
    };

    document.querySelectorAll("[data-solid-open]").forEach((button) => {
      button.addEventListener("click", () => {
        const index = Number(button.getAttribute("data-solid-open"));
        openModal(index);
      });
    });

    closeButton?.addEventListener("click", closeModal);
    overlay?.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
      if (event.target === overlay) {
        closeModal();
      }
    });

    window.addEventListener("keydown", (event) => {
      if (event.key === "Escape") {
        closeModal();
      }
    });
  </script>

  <style>
    .solid-page {
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, #221e1a 0%, #2a2018 42%, #1a2e28 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 2rem 1rem 3rem;
    }

    .solid-shell {
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 1120px;
    }

    .solid-back {
      align-items: center;
      background: rgba(247, 243, 238, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(247, 243, 238, 0.14);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: #f7f3ee;
      display: inline-flex;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      padding: 0.72rem 1rem;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .solid-back:hover {
      background: rgba(247, 243, 238, 0.14);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .solid-banner {
      margin: 0 auto 1.75rem;
      max-width: 44rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .solid-banner .tag {
      background: rgba(196, 149, 106, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(196, 149, 106, 0.32);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: #c4956a;
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.64rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .solid-banner h1 {
      color: #f7f3ee;
      font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 4.4rem);
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.04;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .solid-banner h1 em {
      color: #2d6a5a;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .solid-banner p {
      color: #a09080;
      font-family: "Lora", serif;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-style: italic;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin: 1rem auto 0;
      max-width: 38rem;
    }

    .solid-stage {
      background: rgba(247, 243, 238, 0.06);
      border-color: rgba(247, 243, 238, 0.08);
      border-radius: 2rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 64rem;
      padding: 2rem 1rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .solid-graph {
      aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 34rem;
      position: relative;
      width: min(100%, 34rem);
    }

    .orbit {
      border: 1px solid rgba(45, 106, 90, 0.22);
      border-radius: 999px;
      left: 50%;
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    }

    .orbit-one {
      animation: pulse 4s ease-in-out infinite;
      height: 34%;
      width: 34%;
    }

    .orbit-two {
      animation: pulse 4s ease-in-out infinite 0.9s;
      height: 52%;
      width: 52%;
    }

    .solid-edge {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(45, 106, 90, 0.08), rgba(196, 149, 106, 0.55), rgba(45, 106, 90, 0.08));
      height: 2px;
      left: 50%;
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      transform-origin: left center;
      width: 32%;
    }

    .edge-top { transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(-90deg); }
    .edge-right { transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(-22deg); }
    .edge-bottom-right { transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(42deg); }
    .edge-bottom-left { transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(138deg); }
    .edge-left { transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(202deg); }

    .solid-center {
      align-items: center;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #2d6a5a 0%, #1a3028 100%);
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(196, 149, 106, 0.5);
      border-radius: 999px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
      color: #f7f3ee;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      height: 8.75rem;
      inset: 50% auto auto 50%;
      justify-content: center;
      position: absolute;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      width: 8.75rem;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .solid-center-title {
      font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
      font-size: 1.9rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    }

    .solid-center-subtitle {
      color: rgba(196, 149, 106, 0.84);
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      margin-top: 0.3rem;
    }

    .solid-node {
      align-items: center;
      background: transparent;
      border: 0;
      color: #f7f3ee;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.48rem;
      position: absolute;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      width: 8.5rem;
      z-index: 3;
    }

    .solid-node::before,
    .solid-node::after {
      border-radius: 999px;
      content: "";
      inset: 0;
      position: absolute;
    }

    .solid-node::before {
      filter: blur(14px);
      opacity: 0.18;
      transform: scale(1.08);
      z-index: -2;
    }

    .solid-node::after {
      background: rgba(247, 243, 238, 0.04);
      border: 1px solid rgba(247, 243, 238, 0.18);
      border-radius: 999px;
      content: "";
      height: 4.9rem;
      left: 50%;
      opacity: 0;
      top: 0.15rem;
      transform: translateX(-50%) scale(0.9);
      transition: opacity 180ms ease, transform 180ms ease;
      width: 4.9rem;
      z-index: -1;
    }

    .solid-node:hover::after,
    .solid-node:focus-visible::after {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateX(-50%) scale(1.06);
    }

    .solid-node:hover .node-letter,
    .solid-node:focus-visible .node-letter {
      transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.03);
    }

    .solid-node:focus-visible {
      outline: none;
    }

    .node-letter {
      align-items: center;
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(247, 243, 238, 0.34);
      border-radius: 999px;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
      display: flex;
      font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      height: 4.55rem;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: transform 180ms ease;
      width: 4.55rem;
    }

    .node-copy {
      align-items: center;
      color: rgba(247, 243, 238, 0.85);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      gap: 0.05rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .tone-green .node-letter {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #3d8c75 0%, #1a4038 100%);
    }

    .tone-green::before { background: #3d8c75; }

    .tone-moss .node-letter {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #5a8a5a 0%, #2a4a2a 100%);
    }

    .tone-moss::before { background: #5a8a5a; }

    .tone-plum .node-letter {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #a04a80 0%, #5a1a48 100%);
    }

    .tone-plum::before { background: #a04a80; }

    .tone-amber .node-letter {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #c4956a 0%, #8a5a30 100%);
    }

    .tone-amber::before { background: #c4956a; }

    .tone-umber .node-letter {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, #8a7060 0%, #4a3828 100%);
    }

    .tone-umber::before { background: #8a7060; }

    .solid-hint {
      color: rgba(196, 149, 106, 0.72);
      font-family: "Lora", serif;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      font-style: italic;
      margin: 1rem auto 0;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .solid-support-grid {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .solid-support-card {
      background: rgba(247, 243, 238, 0.07);
      border: 1px solid rgba(247, 243, 238, 0.08);
      border-radius: 1.5rem;
      color: #f7f3ee;
      padding: 1.4rem;
    }

    .support-label {
      color: #c4956a;
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.64rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .solid-support-card h2 {
      font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
      font-size: 1.45rem;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .solid-support-card p {
      color: rgba(247, 243, 238, 0.72);
      font-family: "Lora", serif;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    }

    .accent-1 { box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(45, 106, 90, 0.3); }
    .accent-2 { box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(138, 58, 106, 0.3); }
    .accent-3 { box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(196, 149, 106, 0.35); }

    .ov {
      align-items: center;
